{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "a16f2c0c6c1a",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-04T20:29:07Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1w7fwrm/how_to_estimate_tokenssec_for_your_hardware/",
  "sourceTitle": "How to estimate tokens/sec for your hardware",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d723d204c325b5d4c2dd5529157b7b647d147ee4ececfde831df22ae6e90628c",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T12:38:33.502908Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T12:50:47.867427Z",
  "totalBlocks": 20,
  "translatedBlocks": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ead713776610235a",
      "translationZh": "我们都希望每秒生成更多 token，但我总是看到大家对于给定硬件能达到怎样的性能感到困惑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e125743f4ec6899d",
      "translationZh": "在解码阶段（TG/s），每生成一个 token，都需要从 VRAM 中读取所有模型权重和 KV 缓存。瓶颈不在计算，而只在内存带宽。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "073e3262b9fc20d5",
      "translationZh": "这意味着，给定模型权重和内存带宽，我们就可以估算出所能达到的最大 TG/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a81756a0f283d52",
      "translationZh": "如果暂时忽略 KV 缓存，公式为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43989d12eb8d88ef",
      "translationZh": "对于混合专家（MoE）模型，计算会更复杂，但对于稠密模型则很简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "143253d9e4772da3",
      "translationZh": "对于 Qwen3.8 27B Q4_K_XL，模型权重大小为 16.8 GB（我们排除了并非每生成一个 token 都要读取的部分：MTP 层和输入嵌入表）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b19fb1f5184e74f",
      "translationZh": "对于 AMD Radeon AI PRO R9700，内存带宽为 637 GB/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cce75c6baf470db",
      "translationZh": "因此，这个模型与硬件组合的理论最大值为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84bfc7fa2392b520",
      "translationZh": "在实际环境中，由于软件/硬件栈的低效率，性能只会比这个水平更低。在我的系统上，用 llama.cpp 运行该模型并使用上述硬件时，我得到的是 29 TG/s，也就是 29 / 38 = 理想值的 76%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f74f4065fc8101ed",
      "translationZh": "此外，随着 KV 缓存增大，每生成一个 token 都要读取这些字节。继续以 Qwen3.8 27B 为例，使用 BF16 格式的 KV 缓存时，每个 token 需要读取 64 KB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "307b4759ea489e9f",
      "translationZh": "完整公式变为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e5aaaf68f60a93c",
      "translationZh": "我们可以把 VRAM GB/s 移到左边，让这个公式更实用。这样就能针对特定模型，绘制每单位 VRAM GS/s 对应的 TG/s 随上下文大小变化的曲线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69c1f768eb0a9951",
      "translationZh": "这样你就可以代入自己的 VRAM GB/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d84bcbfff6dc5ef5",
      "translationZh": "对于内存带宽为 1.8 TB/s 的 5090",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "271ce18d979119b6",
      "translationZh": "假设整个模型和上下文都位于 VRAM 中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e209b7294c4a80fc",
      "translationZh": "简化公式仅适用于稠密模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ba1567640186902",
      "translationZh": "推测解码是在这些基础数值之上额外加入的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ea6edec1771f78a",
      "translationZh": "这些是理论最大值。由于软件/硬件的效率损失，实际数值会更低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5821632f37f9b35",
      "translationZh": "绘图使用了 AI。其余内容均由我撰写。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab1a90ed0978346e",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Pyrolistical 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "decoding phase",
      "briefZh": "解码阶段",
      "explanationZh": "模型逐个生成 token 的阶段，文中讨论的是这一阶段的生成速度。"
    },
    {
      "term": "model weights",
      "briefZh": "模型权重",
      "explanationZh": "模型学习得到的参数；文中用其数据量估算每生成一个 token 所需读取的数据量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "KV cache",
      "briefZh": "键值缓存",
      "explanationZh": "缓存注意力机制中的键和值，以便生成后续 token 时复用。"
    },
    {
      "term": "VRAM",
      "briefZh": "显存",
      "explanationZh": "图形处理器使用的内存，文中用于存放模型权重和 KV 缓存。"
    },
    {
      "term": "memory bandwidth",
      "briefZh": "内存带宽",
      "explanationZh": "单位时间内可传输的内存数据量；本文具体指显存的数据读取带宽。"
    },
    {
      "term": "mixture of expert (MoE) models",
      "briefZh": "混合专家模型",
      "explanationZh": "包含多个专家子网络的模型，其生成速度的估算比稠密模型更复杂。"
    },
    {
      "term": "dense models",
      "briefZh": "稠密模型",
      "explanationZh": "与混合专家模型相对，通常每次推理都会使用全部或绝大部分参数的模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "input embedding table",
      "briefZh": "输入嵌入表",
      "explanationZh": "将输入 token 映射为向量表示的参数表；文中将其排除在每个 token 都需读取的权重之外。"
    },
    {
      "term": "software/hardware stack",
      "briefZh": "软硬件栈",
      "explanationZh": "运行模型所依赖的软件与硬件层级，其效率会影响实际性能。"
    },
    {
      "term": "BF16",
      "briefZh": "数值格式",
      "explanationZh": "一种 16 位浮点数格式，文中用于存储 KV 缓存。"
    },
    {
      "term": "context size",
      "briefZh": "上下文大小",
      "explanationZh": "模型处理的上下文长度，会影响 KV 缓存大小及其读取开销。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Speculative decoding",
      "briefZh": "推测解码",
      "explanationZh": "一种加速模型生成的解码方法，先推测后续输出，再进行验证。"
    },
    {
      "term": "theorical maximums",
      "briefZh": "理论最大值",
      "explanationZh": "指理论条件下可达到的最高数值；原文 theorical 是 theoretical 的拼写错误。"
    },
    {
      "term": "inefficiencies",
      "briefZh": "效率损失",
      "explanationZh": "指软件或硬件未能充分发挥性能，导致实际数值低于理论最大值。"
    },
    {
      "term": "plot",
      "briefZh": "图表",
      "explanationZh": "此处指用于呈现数据的图表。"
    }
  ],
